   "text": "I know. But problem is  patients want blood draw done in office because they see they get big bills at hospital owned practices.\n\nInsurance pays $2.50 for blood draw!\n\nWe tried the future orders and send patients to LabCorp. Patients hate going anywhere else and insurance does not pay primary care.\n\nSo doctors in primary care are no longer able to provide longitudinal care and this generates extra referrals.",
