   "conversationId": "2102950787383169351",
   "text": "People do not remember if you help them or not. But, they remember how they felt when they were with you.\n\nIt does not matter how hard you try to provide best care, reasonable prices and highest access. They still blame you when you say insurance  did not pay the claim and their prescriptions are denied.\n\nEven though you had no role in the denial they still blame you because you made them feel bad.\n\nSo please keep insurance outside the office.  Preferably only on the fax machine.\n\nBloody insurance.",
   "lang": "en",
   "createdAt": "2026-09-24T02:38:33.000Z",
   "type": "tweet",
