   "conversationId": "2102861292365386210",
   "text": "But most of the time patients would say, I saw you one month ago. Today's visit is because you said repeat this in a month then.  So today's visit continuation of previous visit and I should not get a bill.\n\nThis is what necessitates quick referral.  \n\nIf Insurance had fair to the orthogonal care done by PCP they would not be on the treadmill.",
