   "conversationId": "2102760926017704147",
   "text": "When the policies are canceled, the hospitals do not get impacted; they are minting money hand over fist. At ten times what it costs.\nWhereas individual physicians are never reimbursed for their time and service and materials. \n\nAmerican healthcare propped by middle men and fake businesses, which want more middlemen",
