   "conversationId": "2084341520606675238",
   "text": "Multiple prices means hidden price. Call any hospital for price, they tell you it depends on your insurance and call insurance they tell you in addition to your insurance it also depends on your hospital and \"in network\" policies present on the date of service and any changes made to these on the date of adjudication. \n\nSo the price is hidden till you get your bill.",
